    "question": {
        "text": "§\n\nName 4 adverse effects of Phenytoin not present in Carbamazepine",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nName 4 adverse effects of Phenytoin not present in Carbamazepine\n\n(1) Megaloblastic anemia\n(2) Gingival hyperplasia\n\n(3) Hirsutism\n\n(4) Decreased bone density\n\n(Strong induction of CYP450 system ⇒ ↑ Steroid metabolism ⇒ ↑ Rate of Vit. D inactivation ⇒ Osteopenia)\n\n[Image: 2d0ec3d91955be0d35d8a92fafe9c4c96f11b65652a1049334dd91fbb51e751a]\n\n[Image: 2b35a6c67651ec6ef8a24ca77653de5ab2bf70c897583d0b0b4231a1ee403cb8]\n\n[Image: a88b81654553b632c800a829bc35f745bb1f661b58dce1b14676c1d92bc124b5]\n\n[Image: 57796778e04de68bb7a9abc30407b9c44ffcabaecee8cb4fb0ad645a4583e529]\n\n4.3 - Carbamazepine, phenytoin, gabapentin, tiagabine, vigabatrin\n[Image: 72a6b493f768ad440d5bb2213cac7f737a4f044ed795c848207a711443df075b]\n\n[Image: c3043f3c2f396c1132e341dc2c19a439589ba89eef0f5980c4f478d378b35668]\n\n[Image: 2bab7a24324cb36e7d3115a5c4ada1905c53d6eb86e4080b17774ff251e1158a]\n\n[Image: fb3ad4700cf08245689b08fc53ae5cccaa6480e193f08f2f661cc14acd0021f5]",
